; ==============================================

; ==============================================
; Bytes 1-2 = number of sprites in a level (count - 1); if it's $FFFF, there are no sprites

; Sprite properties
;
; Byte 1 = index of the NPCObjectPtrs table
; Byte 2 = index of the loc_34DAE table
;
; The following properties depend on the object referenced by the index in the NPCObjectPtrs table.
; Here's what I found out:
;
